  "body": "Here is an excellent opportunity to build and develop your dream home in one of North Auckland's most sought-after suburbs, “Millwater”.\r\n\r\nLot 8 - 452m2 (more or less) is one of ten quality sections ready for all prospective developers and future homeowners. The Title is to be issued approximately latter half of the year 2027.\r\n\r\nMillwater is one of the fastest-growing areas in Auckland, close to regional parks, motorway access to Silverdale, Albany, Auckland CBD, and the bus station. Excellent schools, shops, and your choice of restaurants and cafes are in the area.\r\n\r\nThis is the perfect opportunity for all prospective developers and future homeowners to build and develop their dream homes. This section is for sale by Negotiation so put your offer in now. Don't hesitate to contact us for further information.",
